/* MangaTranslater — package-level copy (English)
 *
 * This table belongs to the SwiftPM resource bundle (`AppCore.Copy`) and is shared
 * by every local package: AppCore / ComicNet / SourceEngine / ComicDownload /
 * AppDatabase. The app target keeps its own table in
 * MangaTranslater/Resources/en.lproj/Localizable.strings.
 *
 * Convention: keys look like `<domain>.<type>.<case>`; placeholders are `%@` (text)
 * and `%ld` (integer). tools/check_localization.py verifies that both languages
 * define exactly the same keys and that every key used in code exists here.
 */


